Producer cooperatives and farmers’ unions and organizations
Farmer’s unions, cooperatives and organizations are the most visible stakeholder institutions representing and supporting local interests at the regional and national levels. 
Along with voicing farmers’ interests on a political level, farmers’ organizations also commonly provide or 
